# Diversity

Diversity is a conceptual tool or principle that helps understand and navigate complex situations. It provides a mental shortcut or framework for making sense of patterns and relationships in the world.

This mental model is referenced in James Surowiecki's The Wisdom of Crowds, where diversity of opinion is one of four conditions for collective intelligence.
